error[SC0196]: `prompt` is reserved and declares nothing
  --> tests/ui/parse/reserved_declaration_word.science:19:1
   |
19 | prompt fit_report(run: String) -> Int:
   | ^^^^^^ a declaration cannot begin with `prompt`
   |
   = note: a prompt is an ordinary function returning `Array of Message`; its arguments carry no schema, so there is nothing for a declaration form to derive and nothing for it to check
